# cine act=lesson fx="code:@reel;clip:stock_people_queue_10;move:right;z:.2;in:right"
The company behind the world's most famous shoe forgot that people have to find it **first**.

// CARD a6-03 · SEE: the wall of archive drawers again; on "saved" a drawer slides out and a real black Stan Smith rises in it: SAVED BY ITS OWN ARCHIVE · SEAM out right
# cine act=lesson fx="code:@archive_drawer;pic:nike_vs_adidas_adidas_stan_smith_black;tag:ARCHIVE · STAN SMITH;go:saved;lab:SAVED BY ITS OWN ARCHIVE;out:right"
And the company facing a seven-hundred-million-euro loss was saved by shoes from its own **archive**.

// CARD a6-04 · SEE: black; the thesis arrives word by word and holds still; "shelf" and "sell" in gold · SEAM hard cut · HOLD
# cine act=lesson fx="code:@thesis_black;lines:The shelf is the strategy.~Where you sell~is part of what you sell.;go:lesson;span:3;size:84;hi:shelf,sell"
{warm} Here's the lesson. The shelf is the strategy. Where you sell is part of what you **sell**.

// CARD a6-05 · SEE: the real OpenStreetMap of Beaverton, the camera travelling; on "investors" a red stamp INVESTOR DAY slams on; on "seventeenth" 17 NOV 2026 beside it · SEAM in right
